    "news": {
      "added": [
        {
          "id": 3430,
          "title": "Policy #33 - Post Quantum Cryptography Implementation",
          "announcement": "<p>The National Information Assurance Partnership/Common Criteria Evaluation and Validation Scheme (NIAP/CCEVS) is pleased to announce the posting of the Post Quantum Cryptography Implementation policy. This policy establishes the timeline for implementation of PQC requirements.</p>\r\n<p>NIAP will issue new or update applicable technical decisions for some Protection Profiles to allow for temporary use of select algorithms which are not CNSA 1.0 compliant for certain functions such as secure boot and trusted update. NIAP strongly recommends vendors adopt CNSA 2.0 compliant algorithms as soon as possible.</p>",
          "types": "1",
          "subject": null,
